<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Relay × Nosana — {{ repo }}</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0; }
th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem; text-align: left; }
th { background: #f0f0f0; }
code { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 3px; }
blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #0070f3; margin: 0; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #f0f8ff; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Relay × Nosana POC — {{ repo }}</h1>
<p>Run: <code>{{ run_id }}</code> &nbsp; Date: {{ date }}</p>

<h2>Headline</h2>
<blockquote>
Relay's compiler raised the share of work routable to Nosana from
<strong>{{ headline.x_pct }}</strong> to <strong>{{ headline.y_pct }}</strong>,
at <strong>{{ headline.cost_nosana_per_1k }}</strong> vs
<strong>{{ headline.cost_frontier_per_1k }}</strong> per 1,000 issues,
using <strong>{{ headline.gpu_hours }}</strong> GPU-hours on Nosana.
</blockquote>

<h2>Capability Matrix</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Task</th><th>Recipient</th><th>Mode</th><th>N</th><th>Score</th><th>95% CI</th><th>Parse fail</th><th>p50 lat (ms)</th></tr>
{% for c in calibration_cells %}
<tr>
  <td>{{ c.task_type }}</td>
  <td><code>{{ c.recipient_id }}</code></td>
  <td>{{ c.mode }}</td>
  <td>{{ c.n }}</td>
  <td>{% if c.mean_score is not none %}{{ "%.3f" | format(c.mean_score) }}{% else %}N/A{% endif %}</td>
  <td>[{{ "%.3f" | format(c.ci_lo or 0) }}, {{ "%.3f" | format(c.ci_hi or 0) }}]</td>
  <td>{{ "%.1f%%" | format((c.parse_fail_rate or 0) * 100) }}</td>
  <td>{{ "%.0f" | format(c.latency_p50_ms or 0) }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>Routing Table</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Task</th><th>Mode</th><th>Recipient</th><th>Score</th><th>Nosana?</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
{% for d in routing_decisions %}
<tr>
  <td>{{ d.task_type }}</td>
  <td>{{ d.mode }}</td>
  <td><code>{{ d.chosen_recipient_id }}</code></td>
  <td>{% if d.expected_score is not none %}{{ "%.3f" | format(d.expected_score) }}{% else %}N/A{% endif %}</td>
  <td>{{ "✓" if d.routes_to_nosana else "✗" }}</td>
  <td>{{ d.reason }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>Limitations</h2>
<ul>
<li>Calibration sample size may be small; confidence intervals are wide.</li>
<li>Ground-truth leakage guards are applied but not exhaustively verified.</li>
<li>Cost estimates are approximate; GPU-hours derived from wall-clock time.</li>
<li>BM25 recall for localization candidates determines an upper bound on hit@5.</li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>
